06GRTFMA4NYGKBRFGSY9T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーでの写真ーー。　　愛知、神戸とツアーが半分終わりまして残すところ神奈川と東京です！　もうね、タオルもうちわも沢山見えて全部に、見えてるよーって言いたい！本当に嬉しいんです😌ありがとう！！　幸せ沢山もらったからお返しできるように頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ406HRTD7XS0BEPSC1TDVN8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ406JTC235G22MKYFQ88K9X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の22時からYouTubeで「10秒天使」プレミア公開されるよーー一緒にみようー。　　　ではまたねーー　河田陽菜"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-53904":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変遅くなりました。\n本当にたくさんのお花ありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX1ZY5JYQCKN62M3ZDHX8B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2110D5GFWKJHTJ1JC61N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX226HYF971T3SKA3V43D3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX238NZMSNS1BS0W4PZFQC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX247Y06QPDXZCPBS26T5K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX257T6FNXH94T91JSMBJX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX266Y4NXPSXS7VC8RAKV0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX27ATWA4P7YCMCJ2HF5ZQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX28AQZFHWD3EMHHFGGW7J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX29AQ6EXWH8W3D2DHG9G0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2AAWHNSC0BN3ZJ4HXA3A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2BCJ6Y7TS1P14Y54YW2B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2CD81BD3F7Z2EH3J7TCG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2DC8BBH6KQN21DM74FNG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHX2ED9R6H7NVNMRC8C2G69","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続く、、"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-25162":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは(｡･ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高瀬愛奈です🐰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪で全国握手会がありました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさんありがとうございました💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VW4K796FCFPT442MXTTTF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14レーン!さりまなふぃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンはさりまかしーと同じレーンでした!!\n舞台でもチームハーモニカで同じで、最近お出かけしたり一緒にいることが多いまかしーと同じレーンですごく楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにも平和な笑顔しかないレーンだねってすごく言っていただけて嬉しかったです😊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まかしーのファンの方もすごく優しくて、\nいつもまかしーと仲良くしてくれてありがとうとか、この二人のペアがすごく好きだよって予想以上にたくさんの方に言っていただけて嬉しかったです✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VW5ZWHZQTJD027Z3NRFSC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VW70H28X05XVKB2W7P94Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n久しぶりのめみぃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに、カスタネットメンバーみんなにも会えて嬉しかったです!\nなんか、久しぶりすぎてみんなキラキラして見えました✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うチームのメンバーみたいですごい変な感じでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングルの握手会もこれで終わりだと思うと本当に早いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーと比べるとファンの方の多さとか、個別握手会のこととか、いろいろ悩むこともあります。だけどやっぱり、みなさんは私の宝物だし、誇りだなってこの6thの期間を通して改めて思いました。\n他のメンバーの握手行ってきたよーって言われて悲しくないと言えばちょっとうそになるけど、でも、そのメンバーからはまなふぃのファンの方って優しいね〜っていつもすごい言ってもらえるので本当に嬉しいです✨\nみなさんは本当に優しすぎるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ファンのみなさんが前まで知り合いじゃなかったのに握手会を重ねるごとにみなさんが仲良くなって連番とかで一緒に来てくださることが最近すごく多くて、本当に嬉しいし、握手することが楽しいです！！\nだからこそみなさんをがっかりさせたくないし、早く結果を出して、応援していて楽しい！って思えるアイドルになりたいんです。\nこんな私ですが、これからも応援してくださると嬉しいです💓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もたくさんの素敵なお花を頂いたのでまた次回のブログに載せますね〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださってありがとうございました💓\n高瀬愛奈／(o・ω・o)＼"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-50812":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはいつでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"準備OK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども。ポカです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__14532737.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目のシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Am I ready?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の情報が続々解禁してます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Music Videoもみんなもう1000回くらいみたんじゃないかな"},{"type":"br